{"parse":{"title":"The Sight and Sound Greatest Films of All Time 2022","pageid":72394430,"revid":1332699136,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Directors'_poll\"><span id=\"Directors.27_poll\"></span>Directors' poll</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=The_Sight_and_Sound_Greatest_Films_of_All_Time_2022&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Directors&#039; poll\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=The_Sight_and_Sound_Greatest_Films_of_All_Time_2022&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Directors&#039; poll\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Stanley_Kubrick_The_Exhibition_-_LACMA_-_2001_A_Space_Odyssey_-_Space_suits_(8999720714).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Stanley_Kubrick_The_Exhibition_-_LACMA_-_2001_A_Space_Odyssey_-_Space_suits_%288999720714%29.jpg/250px-Stanley_Kubrick_The_Exhibition_-_LACMA_-_2001_A_Space_Odyssey_-_Space_suits_%288999720714%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Stanley_Kubrick_The_Exhibition_-_LACMA_-_2001_A_Space_Odyssey_-_Space_suits_%288999720714%29.jpg/500px-Stanley_Kubrick_The_Exhibition_-_LACMA_-_2001_A_Space_Odyssey_-_Space_suits_%288999720714%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"4912\" data-file-height=\"2760\" /></a><figcaption>Props of <i>2001, A Space Odyssey</i></figcaption></figure>\n<p>In the 2022 directors' poll, <i><a href=\"/wiki/2001:_A_Space_Odyssey_(film)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2001: A Space Odyssey (film)\">2001: A Space Odyssey</a></i> was ranked first,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> replacing <i><a href=\"/wiki/Tokyo_Story\" title=\"Tokyo Story\">Tokyo Story</a></i> from 2012 and <i><a href=\"/wiki/Citizen_Kane\" title=\"Citizen Kane\">Citizen Kane</a></i>, which held the top spot in both of the directors' polls previous to that.\n</p><p>The top 10 from the directors' list are:\n</p>\n<ol><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"1\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/2001:_A_Space_Odyssey_(film)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2001: A Space Odyssey (film)\">2001: A Space Odyssey</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Stanley_Kubrick\" title=\"Stanley Kubrick\">Stanley Kubrick</a>, 1968)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"2\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Citizen_Kane\" title=\"Citizen Kane\">Citizen Kane</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Orson_Welles\" title=\"Orson Welles\">Orson Welles</a>, 1941)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"3\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Godfather\" title=\"The Godfather\">The Godfather</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Francis_Ford_Coppola\" title=\"Francis Ford Coppola\">Francis Ford Coppola</a>, 1972)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"4\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Jeanne_Dielman,_23_quai_du_Commerce,_1080_Bruxelles\" title=\"Jeanne Dielman, 23 quai du Commerce, 1080 Bruxelles\">Jeanne Dielman, 23 quai du Commerce, 1080 Bruxelles</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Chantal_Akerman\" title=\"Chantal Akerman\">Chantal Akerman</a>, 1975)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"4\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Tokyo_Story\" title=\"Tokyo Story\">Tokyo Story</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Ozu_Yasujiro\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ozu Yasujiro\">Ozu Yasujiro</a>, 1953)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"6\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Vertigo_(film)\" title=\"Vertigo (film)\">Vertigo</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Alfred_Hitchcock\" title=\"Alfred Hitchcock\">Alfred Hitchcock</a>, 1958)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"6\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/8%C2%BD\" title=\"8\u00bd\">8\u00bd</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Federico_Fellini\" title=\"Federico Fellini\">Federico Fellini</a>, 1963)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"8\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Mirror_(1975_film)\" title=\"Mirror (1975 film)\">Mirror</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Andrei_Tarkovsky\" title=\"Andrei Tarkovsky\">Andrei Tarkovsky</a>, 1975)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"9\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Close-Up_(1990_film)\" title=\"Close-Up (1990 film)\">Close-up</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Abbas_Kiarostami\" title=\"Abbas Kiarostami\">Abbas Kiarostami</a>, 1989)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"9\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/In_the_Mood_for_Love\" title=\"In the Mood for Love\">In the Mood for Love</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Wong_Kar_Wai\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wong Kar Wai\">Wong Kar Wai</a>, 2000)</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li value=\"9\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Persona_(1966_film)\" title=\"Persona (1966 film)\">Persona</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/Ingmar_Bergman\" title=\"Ingmar Bergman\">Ingmar Bergman</a>, 1966)</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1333433106\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.133)}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-free.id-lock-free a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Lock-green.svg\")righ